{"id": "86094", "name": "דוגמה לפולינום ריבועי עם שורשים נתונים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Give an example of a quadratic with roots at \\(x={{CT:0}}\\) and \\(x={{CT:1}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> A number \\(r\\) is a root of a polynomial exactly when \\((x-r)\\) is a factor, so the product of the two factors is a quadratic with the required roots.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — A factor for each root</b><br>The root \\(x={{CT:0}}\\) gives the factor \\({{CT:2}}\\), and the root \\(x={{CT:1}}\\) gives the factor \\({{CT:3}}\\). Their product is a polynomial of degree \\(2\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p(x)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Checking the roots</b><br>A product is zero exactly when one of its factors is zero, so<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p({{CT:0}})=({{CT:5}})\\cdot({{CT:6}})=0,\\qquad p({{CT:1}})=({{CT:7}})\\cdot({{CT:8}})=0. \\]</p>Opening the brackets gives the same quadratic in expanded form:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p(x)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The answer is not unique</b><br>Multiplying by any non-zero constant does not change the roots, so for example \\({{CT:10}}\\) is also a correct answer. One answer is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "pn:subst(n,x,ans1);\npm:subst(m,x,ans1);\nd:degree(ans1,x);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.34, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Not quad.", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer should be a quadratic but is not.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "pn", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.33, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "No first root.", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer should have a root at \\(x={{CT:0}}\\) but does not.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "pm", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.33, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "No second root.", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer should have a root at \\(x={{CT:1}}\\) but does not.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["m", "n"], "nvariants": 9}